      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "JOCK FROM IBROX (3) continues to race in super honest form hitting the frame at all 12 runs and has won two of last three, the latest winning (30.30) over 520m at this track. Has never missed the frame here at the trip from four starts. Has the ability and looks a key chance this line-up. BANDIT ALEX (2) found traffic in the run and collided, missing the frame when a 21 length seventh (30.80) at this track in a Grade 5. May be worth another try. MAYBE NEXT WEEK (1) broke a string of placings finishing in the money two on end before a last start fourth (22.91) at Richmond. Solid formlines coming through his last run. One of the main contenders. BAIL JUMPER (6) scored by 0.8 lengths last time (30.40) in a Grade 5 over 520m at this track. Has already won two times from this draw.",
